Hair can be sensor/probe, insulation, display, weapon/tool-like structure, record, cordage, filter, boundary, signal, camouflage, material, archive—and khipu adds something particularly important: arrangement can turn strands into an external memory/notation system.

So when you ask:

What could we mean?

I think the answer is bigger than polysemy.

