Take exactly the same shard and send it to the Engineering Deck.

A mechanical imp sees fiber.

A biological imp sees sensor/protection/growth.

An information imp sees persistent trace.

A cultural imp sees signal/identity.

A materials imp sees keratin structure.

A khipu imp sees addressable topology.

